   "file": "edit.js",
   "what": "the find bar focuses its field as it opens (Pierre 1.6.4 left it unfocused and focused it a frame later, by its frame callback's select()), and that frame selects the query only while the field holds focus or focus is still where it was as the bar opened, so it never takes focus back from where you went",
